    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything just feels like noise lately. i wake up, look at my calendar, and it’s just hundreds of decisions i don’t even care about anymore. i'm hitting all my targets, the board is happy, the numbers are up... but i feel like a ghost in my own life. i'm just moving through these meetings like a machine. i'm so incredibly tired of just existing like this.",
